# Lowercase paths to the Forager page (owner, "Lowercase address", Forager RECORD -2194).
# Exact paths only, no splat: /forager/<anything else> is not a page and gets the 404 page.
# Matching is case-sensitive, so /Forager/ itself is served, not redirected.
/forager    /Forager/   301
/forager/   /Forager/   301

